extraction_notes: "PAGE SPAN: the class heading is printed 71 (cache p072, WELDED - read from a render) and the Money, Cybernetics and O.C.C. Bonuses blocks end printed 72. The Hand to Hand: Commando description that follows runs printed 72-73 and is the catalog''s skill row, not class text, so it is not repeated here. HAND TO HAND: printed as Commando and unchangeable, so `costs: {}` offers no other style. MOS SKILLS: the book''s four related picks from one special-training area at +10% are stored as an O.C.C. choice group of four over the five areas, and occ_related_skills starts at zero with the book''s two picks at levels two, five, nine and twelve; that the four must share one area is in the note, not enforced. The book''s Piloting area is the Pilot category. LANGUAGE: American plus one of choice at +20%; the native tongue stays at 98% and the other goes through Language: Other. BONUSES: +2D6 S.D.C. and +1 M.E. are unconditional and stored. Equipment: Standard Coalition Dead Boy armor is stored as the CWC standard CA-4; the rifle and sidearm choices are the CS energy weapons in the catalog; 4 E-clips for each weapon is eight; distancing binoculars are the generic binoculars row; the non-energy weapon choice is a sample of catalog S.D.C. automatics and bows. The daily-use vehicle is a vehicle, not gear, and is in restrictions. Money: monthly salary 2,000 credits plus combat pay; starts with one month''s pay, which is starting_money."
